# Secrets and Logging

Never log, print, or include in error messages:

- API keys and tokens (Questrade refresh/access tokens)
- Passwords
- Account numbers (redact or truncate if needed)

Use `logger.debug` sparingly for sensitive data; prefer structured logs that exclude secrets. If an exception might contain secrets, sanitize before logging.
